Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:35.00,PZ,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(0,0)\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\bord1\fs40\3c&HC4C4C4&\pos(1875,385)}30
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,PZ,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.30,0:12:26.80,PZ,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(0,0)\fn@方正中雅宋_GBK\bord1\fs40\frz-90\3c&HC4C4C4&\pos(1875,127)}勇者辛美尔死后第　年\N北部高原科里多尔湖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.30,0:12:26.80,PZ,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(0,0)\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\bord1\fs40\3c&HC4C4C4&\pos(1875,385)}30
